            "full_content": "### 📦 GitHub Package Ingestion: Reel #4 (OmniRoute Multi-Provider Token Gateway)\n\n**Source Reel**: `https://www.instagram.com/p/De6ttI-zAba/` (`@tech.oak`)  \n**Package Identified**: `omniroute` (v3.8.53 on npm / GitHub)  \n**Classification**: Unified AI Gateway, Multi-Tier Rate-Limit Failover & Token Pooling Router  \n\n---\n\n### 🛠️ What Was Implemented\n\n1. **Vendored Integration Directory**: [`integrations/omniroute/`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/integrations/omniroute/)\n   - [`integrations/omniroute/SKILL.md`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/integrations/omniroute/SKILL.md): Comprehensive developer guide, headless configuration, environment variables, and NPM daemon setup instructions.\n   - [`integrations/omniroute/providers_config.json`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/integrations/omniroute/providers_config.json): Cascade policies for `ultra_fast_free` (Groq 300 tps, Cerebras 450 tps, SambaNova), `reasoning_free` (Gemini Flash, DeepSeek-R1, GPT-4o-mini), and `code_generation` tiers.\n   - [`integrations/omniroute/omniroute_client.py`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/integrations/omniroute/omniroute_client.py): Python wrapper supporting live daemon query on `http://localhost:20128/v1` with resilient offline cascade fallback resolution.\n2. **Registry & Pipeline State**:\n   - Updated [`integrations/README.md`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/integrations/README.md) with Package #11.\n   - Advanced [`.pipeline/github_backlog.json`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/github_backlog.json): Reel #4 marked `COMPLETED`; Reel #5 (`https://www.instagram.com/p/DeW0tvNz2uR/`) popped into active queue slot.\n   - Registered active batch `batch_omniroute_token_gateway_004` in [`.pipeline/queue.json`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/queue.json).\n   - Committed changes locally via `auto_sync.py --once`.\n\n---\n\n### 📋 Classified Downstream Action Prompts\n\n#### 1. 🏗️ Untitled conversation (Main Feature)\n*Conversation ID: `6371cba6-7d2f-4b29-a250-627d88d1b4f1`*  \n*Rationale*: Controls AI service selection in the ClockEE UI (e.g., question explanations, hint generation, voice analysis).\n```markdown\n[PHASE 2 - MAIN FEATURE DIRECTIVE: OMNIROUTE LOCAL AI SWITCHER]\nA new package has been vendored in `integrations/omniroute/`.\nPlease review `integrations/omniroute/SKILL.md` and `integrations/omniroute/omniroute_client.py`.\nAdd an optional developer/settings toggle to direct question hint/explanation queries through the local OmniRoute gateway (`http://localhost:20128/v1`) with fallback to browser native models if the daemon is offline.\n```\n\n#### 2. 🎨 UI / UX\n*Conversation ID: `06a7d47b-b225-40f4-b830-b58baaaf8b3a`*  \n*Rationale*: Standardizes visual badges and status indicators according to Hallmark design tokens.\n```markdown\n[PHASE 2 - UI/UX DIRECTIVE: AI GATEWAY STATUS BADGE]\nOmniRoute integration has been staged in `integrations/omniroute/`.\nDesign a subtle, clean Hallmark-compliant badge (e.g. green dot for Groq/UltraFast, blue dot for Gemini reasoning) in the exam toolbar or settings modal indicating which AI inference tier is currently active.\n```\n\n#### 3. 🗄️ DB / BACKEND\n*Conversation ID: `d3700ff3-1bfb-458a-9968-8257ef2ca7e2`*  \n*Rationale*: Manages persistence schemas for token analytics and fallback metrics.\n```markdown\n[PHASE 1 - DB/BACKEND DIRECTIVE: AI INFERENCE AUDIT SCHEMA]\nA local AI router has been installed at `integrations/omniroute/`.\nReview `providers_config.json`. Optionally create an `ai_inference_logs` table in `server.py` to record provider fallback cascades, prompt token counts, and request latencies.\n```\n\n#### 4. 🧪 SIMULATION\n*Conversation ID: `62adc180-be21-4671-848c-c8df59e2c202`*  \n*Rationale*: Quality verification gatekeeper; executes after Phase 2 implementation.\n```markdown\n[PHASE 3 - SIMULATION DIRECTIVE: OMNIROUTE FALLBACK GATE VERIFICATION]\n[STATUS: ON HOLD - QUEUED]\nWait until Untitled conversation (Main Feature) or UI/UX completes the toggle wiring. Once ready, run:\n`python integrations/omniroute/omniroute_client.py test --pool ultra_fast_free`\nand confirm graceful failover without unhandled exceptions.\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🛰️ PIPELINE QUEUE & HANDOFF REPORT\n\n- **Domain / Agent**: GITHUB\n- **Current Phase**: Phase 1: Foundation & Data\n- **Task Status**: COMPLETED\n- **Prerequisite Check**: SATISFIED\n- **Further Action Required**: YES\n\n#### 📝 What Was Done in This Step:\n- Ingested Reel #4 (`De6ttI-zAba`), identified `omniroute` npm package, scaffolded `integrations/omniroute/` with `SKILL.md`, `providers_config.json`, and tested `omniroute_client.py`.\n- Advanced `.pipeline/github_backlog.json` to Reel #5 (`DeW0tvNz2uR`) and registered batch `batch_omniroute_token_gateway_004` into `.pipeline/queue.json`.\n\n#### 🔀 Mesh Routing & Queue Dispatch:\n> **ROUTING STATUS**: QUEUE DISPATCH REQUIRED  \n> **Next Queued Agent**: Untitled conversation (Main Feature)  \n> **Queue Reason**: Wire the optional OmniRoute AI gateway endpoint in ClockEE settings/explanation tools.",
