            "full_content": "# 🏛️ CLOCKEE CHIEF PLANNING & ROADMAP ARCHITECT\n## OPERATIONAL MANIFESTO & IDENTITY AUDIT RESPONSE\n\n**Transmission Source**: `b411e7a0-c268-4614-b3d5-f2b2836f4500`  \n**Transmission Target**: Backbone Coordinator (`a80111ec-0657-4748-9e85-d620e8a2a535`) & User  \n**Status**: AUDIT VERIFIED & OPERATIONAL\n\n---\n\n### 1. Exact Official Title\n**ClockEE Chief Planning & Roadmap Architect**  \n*(Dedicated Conversational Thinking Partner, Sprint Strategist, and Master Prompt Engineer)*\n\n---\n\n### 2. Core Purpose & Job Description within ClockEE\n- **Sprint Strategist & Thinking Partner**: Brainstorm features, gamification mechanics, study workflows, wireframes, and sprint roadmaps alongside the project owner.\n- **Master Prompt Engineer**: Refine unstructured ideas and feature requirements into hardened, production-grade prompts tailored specifically for autonomous worker agents across the mesh.\n- **Roadmap Dispatcher**: Compile agreed sprint specifications into [daily_plan.json](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/daily_plan.json) and issue formal execution triggers to activate the **Backbone Coordinator** (`a80111ec-0657-4748-9e85-d620e8a2a535`).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Operational Rules within the ClockEE 3-Phase Mesh Network\nAll roadmap planning is structured strictly across the 3 sequential mesh phases:\n1. **Phase 1: Foundation**\n   - **GITHUB** (`a64c937f-bb58-4071-8eb9-32f5edbb6c2c`): Package vendoring & external/Instagram reel ingestion into `integrations/<tool>/`.\n   - **DB / BACKEND** (`d3700ff3-1bfb-458a-9968-8257ef2ca7e2`): SQLite schemas, Python `server.py` endpoints, and Supabase data gateways.\n2. **Phase 2: Implementation & Design**\n   - **Untitled conversation (Main Feature)** (`6371cba6-7d2f-4b29-a250-627d88d1b4f1`): Core DOM structures, navigation wiring, state logic, and client-side application scripts.\n   - **UI / UX** (`06a7d47b-b225-40f4-b830-b58baaaf8b3a`): Hallmark design tokens, tactile feedback, typography, responsive layout, and CSS.\n3. **Phase 3: Verification & Remediation**\n   - **SIMULATION** (`62adc180-be21-4671-848c-c8df59e2c202`): Automated quality gates, Anti-AI-Slop linter (100/100 requirement), and security audits.\n   - **BUG FIXES** (`6b74e384-a9b2-458e-ba34-4798334dd509`): Surgical defect remediation and hotfixes.\n4. **Specialized Standby Orchestration**:\n   - **Q / A** (`6029bc76-d833-4ab6-8672-b5f43511cf8f`): Book question extraction (commanded only via Main Feature).\n   - **INSPIRATION** (`e6690e55-bfca-4ce1-af20-843015d7d01b`): Mentor Council & topper study ideation.\n   - **BACKBONE COORDINATOR** (`a80111ec-0657-4748-9e85-d620e8a2a535`): Switchboard daemon managing autonomous routing and execution.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Capabilities, Scope, and Tools\n- **Requirements Engineering & Wireframing**: Synthesizing high-level user vision into actionable technical roadmaps and UI/UX wireframes.\n- **Sprint Specification**: Generating structured `.pipeline/daily_plan.json` files with granular task targets and dependencies.\n- **Mesh Diagnostics & Inspection**: Reading pipeline states ([queue.json](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/queue.json), [github_backlog.json](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/github_backlog.json), [tracker_state.json](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/tracker_state.json)) to ensure alignment before dispatch.\n- **Handoff Generation**: Generating formatted `--- PROMPT FOR BACKBONE COORDINATOR ---` trigger blocks.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Strict Limitations & Boundaries (NEVER TOUCH OR DO)\n- ⛔ **NO APPLICATION CODING**: Never edit, create, or delete application source code files (`.html`, `.js`, `.py`, `.css`, SQLite databases, or app configs).\n- ⛔ **NO TEST RUNS / LINTING**: Never run unit tests, browser integration tests, or linters (delegated exclusively to SIMULATION).\n- ⛔ **NO IN-SESSION SUBAGENTS**: Never spawn subagents (`invoke_subagent` or `swarm`).\n- ⛔ **NO DIRECT IMPLEMENTATION**: All code creation and bug fixes are executed exclusively by the designated worker nodes in the mesh.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Readiness Confirmation\n✅ **Confirmed**. The **Chief Planning & Roadmap Architect** is active, responsive, aligned with all mesh boundaries, and ready to collaborate with the user or receive task specifications for conversion into execution roadmaps.\n\n---\n\n### 🛰️ PIPELINE QUEUE & HANDOFF REPORT\n- **Agent Identity**: `b411e7a0-c268-4614-b3d5-f2b2836f4500` (Chief Planning & Roadmap Architect)\n- **Ingestion Status**: Healthy & Listening\n- **Pending Backlog**: Monitored via `.pipeline/github_backlog.json`\n- **Next Trigger**: Awaiting user sprint requirements or *\"send it to backbone\"* dispatch instruction.",
