            "preview": "# 🎯 Vercel Roadmap Finalized & Locked  Both decisions have been integrated directly into the master execution plan:  1. **Environment Configuration Strategy**:    - Production secrets (`SUPABASE_URL`,",
            "full_content": "# 🎯 Vercel Roadmap Finalized & Locked\n\nBoth decisions have been integrated directly into the master execution plan:\n\n1. **Environment Configuration Strategy**:\n   - Production secrets (`SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`) will be managed directly in the **Vercel Project Dashboard**.\n   - `backend/db.py` and `api/index.py` will read from standard serverless environment variables, while maintaining graceful fallback to local `env.js` for offline development.\n2. **Production Domain Target**:\n   - Anchored to **`https://clockee.vercel.app`**.\n   - Main Feature and Backend prompts have been updated to ensure all Supabase OAuth redirect handlers, CORS origins, and API base routes dynamically bind to this domain in production while preserving `localhost` compatibility.\n\nThe finalized plan is documented in:\n📄 **[vercel_deployment_master_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/Kunal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/b411e7a0-c268-4614-b3d5-f2b2836f4500/vercel_deployment_master_plan.md)**\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Ready for Dispatch?\nWhenever you are ready to initiate the build across the worker mesh, just give the command:  \n👉 *\"Send it to backbone\"* or *\"Start today's work\"*\n\nI will immediately compile `.pipeline/daily_plan.json` and transmit the execution signal to the **Backbone Coordinator** (`a80111ec-0657-4748-9e85-d620e8a2a535`).",
