            "full_content": "### ⚡ Why It Paused & How We Permanently Solved It\n\nYou made an exact, sharp diagnosis of the IPC switchboard:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Root Cause Analysis\n1. **The Idle Backbone Gap**: \n   - Antigravity conversation sessions only process turns when active. When Backbone finishes replying to you, its turn ends and it sleeps until a new event wakes it up.\n   - The earlier background runner task (`task-2115`) was terminated during context compaction.\n2. **The Result**:\n   - **DB / BACKEND** completed **TASK-01** (built [`api/index.py`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/api/index.py) and connected to Supabase Cloud) and output `--- PROMPT FOR GITHUB ---`.\n   - But because no daemon was running in the background, the handoff prompt sat on the floor waiting for Backbone to wake up and forward it.\n\n---\n\n### 2. The Permanent 24/7 Solution: [`mesh_continuous_bridge.py`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/mesh_continuous_bridge.py)\n\nWe have built and launched a dedicated, crash-proof background daemon:\n\n- **1.5-Second Continuous Heartbeat**:\n  - Scans all 10 conversation transcripts every **1.5 seconds** in an infinite, non-terminating loop.\n- **Zero-Latency Auto-Forwarding**:\n  - The instant ANY agent outputs `--- PROMPT FOR [Target] ---`, it extracts the full multiline text and dispatches it directly to the target session via `language_server.exe agentapi send-message`.\n- **SHA-256 Deduplication**:\n  - Maintains [`.pipeline/dispatched_prompts.json`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/dispatched_prompts.json) so no prompt is ever dispatched twice.\n- **Continuous Remote Sync**:\n  - Streams live state to both [**`tracker.html`**](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/tracker.html) and Supabase Cloud (`mesh_tracker_state`) every cycle.\n- **Detached Windows Service Script**:\n  - Added [`.pipeline/start_mesh_daemon.ps1`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/.pipeline/start_mesh_daemon.ps1) so the bridge can also run as an independent background process on your machine that survives IDE reloads.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Immediate Results & Current State\nThe moment `mesh_continuous_bridge.py` started, it caught the handoff from DB / BACKEND and auto-dispatched it to GITHUB in under 1 second:\n\n```text\n[2026-11-16 13:11:05] 🚀 [AUTO-DISPATCH] Transferring prompt: DB / BACKEND ➔ GITHUB (Step #846)\n[2026-11-16 13:11:06] ✔ Successfully delivered to GITHUB (a64c937f...)\n```\n\n- **TASK-01**: **COMPLETED** by DB / BACKEND ([`api/index.py`](file:///d:/Desktop/ClockEE/api/index.py) verified with live Supabase Cloud).\n- **TASK-02**: **IN-PROGRESS** in **GITHUB** (`a64c937f...` configuring production `vercel.json` rewrites and `.vercelignore`).\n- **Continuous Bridge**: Running continuously in the background (`task-2399`). As soon as GITHUB finishes, the bridge will immediately forward the handoff to **Main Feature** for **TASK-03** without you or me having to intervene!",
